q01. **POST /api/v1/memos**

Defined in the `google.api.http` annotation on the RPC in `proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto:21-25`:

```
rpc CreateMemo(CreateMemoRequest) returns (Memo) {
  option (google.api.http) = {
    post: "/api/v1/memos"
    body: "memo"
  };
```

The request body is bound to the `memo` field of `CreateMemoRequest` (`proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto:293-300`), so a REST caller posts the Memo object directly. Server-side, the RPC is implemented by `APIV1Service.CreateMemo` in `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go:70` and bridged through `ConnectServiceHandler.CreateMemo` in `server/router/api/v1/connect_services.go:306`.
